body:
To the FOIA Officer, ${addressee}:

Under the Freedom of Information Act, 5 U.S.C. 552, I request:

${request_list}

According to the agency's published FOIA log, each request listed above was closed with records released in full or in part. I ask only for the records as they were already released, with the same redactions. I do not need the original requester's name, contact details or correspondence.

Please provide the records electronically, in the form in which they were released. If they have already been posted publicly, for example in a FOIA reading room, a link to them is sufficient.

Fee category: ${fee_category_text}

Fee waiver: under 5 U.S.C. 552(a)(4)(A)(iii), I request a waiver of all fees. Disclosure of the requested information is in the public interest because it is likely to contribute significantly to public understanding of the operations or activities of the government: these records show how the agency handles FOIA requests and what it has released to the public under the FOIA. Disclosure is not primarily in my commercial interest. I will make the information available to the public as follows: ${dissemination}

${fee_paragraph}

${requester_name}
${requester_block}
